---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import FlightLine from './FlightLine.astro';
---

<section id="open-source" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-40 md:py-56">
  <SectionHeading index="04" label="OPEN SOURCE" />

  <p class="mt-16 max-w-prose text-lg leading-relaxed md:text-xl" data-reveal>
    Everything we build is open by default. Modules are designed in the open,
    reviewed in the open, and released under the MIT license.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-3 max-w-prose text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted" data-reveal>
    我们构建的一切都默认开源：模块在公开中设计、审查，并以 MIT 协议发布。
  </p>

  <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-8" data-reveal>
    <a
      href="https://github.com/aukcraft"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="flight inline-flex items-center border border-hairline px-6 py-3 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-teal"
    >
      github.com/aukcraft
      <FlightLine />
    </a>
    <a
      class="link-line font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em]"
      href="https://github.com/eeymoo/peregrine/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">Contributing guide&thinsp;↗</a
    >
  </div>

  <!--
    Community stats (stars / contributors) intentionally omitted at launch:
    per design.md risk note, this block stays hidden until a live GitHub API
    integration ships in a follow-up change — no static placeholder numbers.
  -->
</section>
